title: llm-stream-guardrails
abstract: >-
  Redact PII and secrets from an LLM response while it streams, without
  buffering it. Streamed output is byte-identical to filtering the whole
  string at once, at any chunk boundary. Zero dependencies, TypeScript, ESM.
